                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} End(\mathbb{C} \otimes \mathbb{O}^2)
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Spin
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 10
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Spin(10)
            is isomorphic to the group of linear transformations generated by elements
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
